2026-07-27T10:07:56.5617506Z i /tmp/Rtmp3E2lhE/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:07:56.5618109Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:07:56.5618557Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:07:56.5618899Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:07:56.5619432Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:07:56.5620293Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:07:56.5621414Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
